WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.367
-Welcome, welcome, welcome.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.901
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:06.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
You're here.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.534
Thank you for being here.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:09.667
Well, guys, this is nice.

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:11.734
Earlier tonight,
the Bidens hosted

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:13.534
the president of South Korea
and his wife

00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:15.934
for a state dinner
at the White House.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:18.334
Yeah, Biden wanted to meet
with the most powerful people

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:21.367
in South Korea,
but BTS was busy, so...

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:27.567
[ Applause ]

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:29.167
But the state dinner was fun.

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:31.234
The South Korean president
was nodding off

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:33.434
because of the jet lag,
and Biden was nodding off

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:38.834
because it was 6:00 p.m.
and that's late, late.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:41.467
I saw that the guests
were served Maryland crabcake,

00:00:41.467 --> 00:00:45.801
fennel and cucumber slaw,
and a yellow squash soup.

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:47.734
Yeah.

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:49.434
Then, like every
other fancy meal,

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:52.133
everyone hit up
a McDonald's immediately after.

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:54.567
"Let me get a quarter pounder.
Starving."

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:56.067
Well, people are
talking about this.

00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:58.434
Today, Disney filed
a lawsuit against

00:00:58.434 --> 00:01:00.501
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:00.501 --> 00:01:02.767
for waging a
"relentless campaign

00:01:02.767 --> 00:01:06.567
to weaponize government power"
against the company. Yeah.

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:07.801
In an official statement,

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.501
the head of Disney's
legal team said...

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:12.834
[ Donald Duck voice ]

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:19.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:23.834
Wow. Thank God.

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:24.868
Thank you very much, Donald.

00:01:24.868 --> 00:01:25.968
-[ As Donald Duck ]
Go duck yourself.

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:27.234
-Oh.

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:29.767
[ Cymbal plays ]
-Duck. Duck.

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:31.200
-Go duck my--
-Go duck yourself.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:33.300
-Yeah.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:36.367
-DeSantis will be represented
by the Florida attorney general,

00:01:36.367 --> 00:01:40.701
while Disney will be represented
by She-Hulk, attorney at law.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:44.934
Disney hadn't hasn't taken
a politician to court

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:47.801
since they sued John Bolton
for copyright infringement.

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:50.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.634 --> 00:01:54.801
Geppetto.

00:01:54.801 --> 00:01:56.667
Speaking of Florida governor,

00:01:56.667 --> 00:01:59.901
apparently former President
Trump is listening to insiders

00:01:59.901 --> 00:02:03.467
who are urging him to make
DeSantis his running mate.

00:02:03.467 --> 00:02:04.801
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:06.801
I have a feeling
adding DeSantis to the ticket

00:02:06.801 --> 00:02:09.100
will be like adding
Mentos to Diet Coke.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:12.434
You know?

00:02:12.434 --> 00:02:14.033
Meanwhile, I read that
Trump is threatening

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.300
to skip the Republican
presidential debates.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.434
Trump was like,

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:19.434
[ As Trump ]
"As people keep telling me,

00:02:19.434 --> 00:02:21.434
I have the right
to remain silent."

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:25.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.367 --> 00:02:28.868
