telling me that."

00:02:28.868 --> 00:02:31.167
A Republican debate
without Trump?

00:02:31.167 --> 00:02:34.901
Even C-SPAN2 was like, "Pass."

00:02:34.901 --> 00:02:36.367
But right now,
Trump has a lot going on.

00:02:36.367 --> 00:02:38.701
He's got a new book,
he's on the campaign trail,

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:40.367
