for an interview.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:49.934
So let's ask him
a few questions right now.

00:02:49.934 --> 00:02:51.968
Mr. Trump,
thanks for doing this.

00:02:51.968 --> 00:02:53.601
-Jimmy Kimmel.

00:02:54.701 --> 00:02:57.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.667 --> 00:03:01.234
-Close enough. Now, you --

00:03:01.234 --> 00:03:03.133
You've got a new book out called
"Letters to Trump."

00:03:03.133 --> 00:03:05.367
How much of your book
did you actually read?

00:03:05.367 --> 00:03:06.767
-Like a page or two pages.

00:03:06.767 --> 00:03:08.934
-Okay. Okay.

00:03:08.934 --> 00:03:10.167
